 dict(id='S08-WHO-ACTIVITY-2020',title='WHO guidelines on physical activity and sedentary behaviour: at a glance',url='https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789240014886',type='official WHO guideline summary',published='2020-11-25',population='Age-specific populations including adults and groups with different conditions, in public-health contexts.',scope='Population guidance for physical activity and sedentary behavior; includes specific applicability and safety considerations.',strength='Guideline gives strong/moderate certainty ratings for some adult recommendations; ratings vary by recommendation and population.',limits='Population guidance does not identify a safe or preferred activity for an individual or prove a specific study-calendar intervention works. The WHO landing page was accessible, but the linked IRIS PDF returned HTTP 403 to the research tool; direct verification of the cited PDF passage remains pending.',rights='WHO material reuse and translations require review; link and paraphrase pending permission.',passages=[dict(id='P09-ACTIVITY-CHOICE',locator='At a glance PDF, key messages and adults section; https://iris.who.int/bitstream/handle/10665/337001/9789240014886-eng.pdf?sequence=1',paraphrase='WHO recognizes physical activity in multiple everyday contexts and presents age- and population-specific public health recommendations.')],candidate='If a student values an accessible activity, discuss an optional activity that fits stated context and request review before scheduling.',misuse='Do not prescribe an intensity, universal quota or medical regimen; do not infer health conditions or claim an individual benefit.'),
